<details class="yc-advanced yc-stock-history"><summary>최근 재고 이력<small>보충·주문 차감·취소·반품 복원·수량 조정, 최근 20건</small></summary><div class="card-body">
<table class="table yc-restock-table"><thead><tr><th>일시</th><th>상품·옵션</th><th>구분</th><th>수량</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($stock_history as $entry): ?><tr><td><?= $this->date((int) $entry['created_at']) ?></td><td><?= $this->e($entry['name']) ?><?php $label = implode(' / ', array_filter([$entry['value1'], $entry['value2'], $entry['value3']], static fn ($v) => $v !== null && $v !== '')); if ($label !== ''): ?><small><?= $this->e($label) ?></small><?php endif ?></td><td><?= $this->e(['restock' => '재고 보충', 'order' => '주문 차감', 'cancel' => '취소 복원', 'return' => '반품 복원', 'admin' => '수량 조정'][$entry['kind']] ?? '재고 변경') ?></td><td><?= (int) $entry['delta'] > 0 ? '+' : '' ?><?= number_format((int) $entry['delta']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach ?>
<?php if ($stock_history === []): ?><tr><td colspan="4">재고 이력이 없습니다.</td></tr><?php endif ?>
</tbody></table></div></details>
